#: ../../openmvcam/shields/ae3-oled-breakout.rst:104
msgid ""
"The 10‑pin 1.27 mm ARM Cortex Debug header on the breakout is wired straight"
" to the AE3's SWD/JTAG lines. All signals are **1.8 V referenced** — use a "
"level‑shifting probe or one whose target voltage tracks ``VCC_REF`` (pin 1)."
msgstr ""
"Header ARM Cortex Debug 1,27 mm 10‑pin pada breakout terhubung langsung ke "
"jalur SWD/JTAG AE3. Semua sinyal **bertegangan referensi 1,8 V** — gunakan "
"probe yang menggeser level atau yang tegangan targetnya mengikuti "
"``VCC_REF`` (pin 1)."

